> hey guys i know this is really stupid , but after 4 years of hacking
> still dunno how to manage two weapon....
> can you keep it simple also otherwise my small brain might overheat and
> explode....

Make sure that both your weapons are one-handed. Quarterstaves, unicorn
horns and dwarvish mattocks are two-handed.

Wield the weapon you want to use as your secondary weapon.

Change weapons by typing 'x' (without the quotes, of course).

Wield the weapon you want to use as your primary weapon (for instance an
artifact).

Type #twoweapon. It's probably enough to type #tw as the game will fill in
the rest for you.

That's all. Note that not all classes can #twoweapon, only the fighter
classes can (is that your problem?) and that you can't use an artifact
weapon as secondary weapon (i.e. you can't twoweapon two artifacts), at
least not in vanilla.

